$DIR/test.p:34:25: cannot use "x" (untyped string constant) as int value in assignment
    v[0] has type int, so it can only hold whole numbers; "x" holds text.
    Plutonium, like Go, never converts between text and numbers automatically.
    (see "Assignability" in the Plutonium spec, section 8.4)
    (run "pluto explain E0023" for a longer explanation)
